{"id":"bc45853615e28d23","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/076_无割相继式演算.md","title":"076 无割相继式演算","display":"076_无割相继式演算","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>修订状态：repair-candidate。原审查评级仅针对备份的原始字节；本稿为授权修复候选。</p>\n</blockquote>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-命题符号与构造子\">1. 命题符号与构造子</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Prop=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Prop=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>公式构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"atm,\\quad neg,\\quad and,\\quad or,\\quad imp.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[atm,\\quad neg,\\quad and,\\quad or,\\quad imp.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>没有量词、项或绑定变量。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-公式形成\">2. 公式形成</h1>\n<p>公式集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Frm_{CF}\">\\(Frm_{CF}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in Prop\">\\(p\\in Prop\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"atm(p)\\in Frm_{CF}\">\\(atm(p)\\in Frm_{CF}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in Frm_{CF}\">\\(A\\in Frm_{CF}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"neg(A)\\in Frm_{CF}\">\\(neg(A)\\in Frm_{CF}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in Frm_{CF}\">\\(A,B\\in Frm_{CF}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"and(A,B)\\in Frm_{CF}\">\\(and(A,B)\\in Frm_{CF}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in Frm_{CF}\">\\(A,B\\in Frm_{CF}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"or(A,B)\\in Frm_{CF}\">\\(or(A,B)\\in Frm_{CF}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in Frm_{CF}\">\\(A,B\\in Frm_{CF}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"imp(A,B)\\in Frm_{CF}\">\\(imp(A,B)\\in Frm_{CF}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-变元、替换与无绑定约定\">3. 变元、替换与无绑定约定</h1>\n<p>变元出现函数满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"PV(atm(p))=\\{p\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[PV(atm(p))=\\{p\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"PV(neg(A))=PV(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[PV(neg(A))=PV(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"PV(and(A,B))=PV(A)\\cup PV(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[PV(and(A,B))=PV(A)\\cup PV(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"PV(or(A,B))=PV(A)\\cup PV(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[PV(or(A,B))=PV(A)\\cup PV(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"PV(imp(A,B))=PV(A)\\cup PV(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[PV(imp(A,B))=PV(A)\\cup PV(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>命题替换集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Sub_{CF}=\\{\\sigma:Prop\\to Frm_{CF}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Sub_{CF}=\\{\\sigma:Prop\\to Frm_{CF}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>命题替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in Sub_{CF}\">\\(\\sigma\\in Sub_{CF}\\)</span> 的扩张满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(atm(p))=\\sigma(p),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(atm(p))=\\sigma(p),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(neg(A))=neg(\\widehat\\sigma(A)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(neg(A))=neg(\\widehat\\sigma(A)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(and(A,B))=and(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(and(A,B))=and(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(or(A,B))=or(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(or(A,B))=or(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(imp(A,B))=imp(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(imp(A,B))=imp(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价为公式字面相等。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-相继式与上下文\">4. 相继式与上下文</h1>\n<p>公式上下文是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Frm_{CF}\">\\(Frm_{CF}\\)</span> 上的有限多重集。相继式集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Seq_{CF}=\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Frm_{CF})\\times\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Frm_{CF}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Seq_{CF}=\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Frm_{CF})\\times\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Frm_{CF}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>写作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta\">\\(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta\\)</span>。上下文相等是多重集外延相等，即每个公式的重数相同。令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{m:X\\to\\mathbb N:\\operatorname{supp}(m)\\text{ 有限}\\}\">\\(\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{m:X\\to\\mathbb N:\\operatorname{supp}(m)\\text{ 有限}\\}\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{supp}(m)=\\{x:m(x)&gt;0\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{supp}(m)=\\{x:m(x)&gt;0\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0_X(x)=0\">\\(0_X(x)=0\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[A](B)=1\">\\([A](B)=1\\)</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B=A\">\\(B=A\\)</span>，否则为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(m\\uplus n)(x)=m(x)+n(x)\">\\((m\\uplus n)(x)=m(x)+n(x)\\)</span>。多重集并按重数相加，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,A=\\Gamma\\uplus[A]\">\\(\\Gamma,A=\\Gamma\\uplus[A]\\)</span>。对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in Sub_{CF}\">\\(\\sigma\\in Sub_{CF}\\)</span>，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma[m](B)=\\sum_{A\\in\\operatorname{supp}(m),\\ \\widehat\\sigma(A)=B}m(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma[m](B)=\\sum_{A\\in\\operatorname{supp}(m),\\ \\widehat\\sigma(A)=B}m(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该有限和保留替换碰撞产生的全部重数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"PV:Frm_{CF}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Prop)\">\\(PV:Frm_{CF}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Prop)\\)</span>，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma:Frm_{CF}\\to Frm_{CF}\">\\(\\widehat\\sigma:Frm_{CF}\\to Frm_{CF}\\)</span> 均为第 3 节的全构造递归扩张。相继式替换为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta)\\widehat\\sigma\n=\n\\widehat\\sigma[\\Gamma]\\Rightarrow\\widehat\\sigma[\\Delta].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta)\\widehat\\sigma\n=\n\\widehat\\sigma[\\Gamma]\\Rightarrow\\widehat\\sigma[\\Delta].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-初始相继式与结构规则\">5. 初始相继式与结构规则</h1>\n<p>初始关系为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Init_{CF}\n=\n\\{\\Gamma,A\\Rightarrow A,\\Delta:\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Frm_{CF}),A\\in Frm_{CF}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Init_{CF}\n=\n\\{\\Gamma,A\\Rightarrow A,\\Delta:\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Frm_{CF}),A\\in Frm_{CF}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>结构规则关系为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{LW}\n=\n\\{(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta,\\Gamma,A\\Rightarrow\\Delta):A\\in Frm_{CF}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{LW}\n=\n\\{(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta,\\Gamma,A\\Rightarrow\\Delta):A\\in Frm_{CF}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{RW}\n=\n\\{(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta,\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A,\\Delta):A\\in Frm_{CF}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{RW}\n=\n\\{(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta,\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A,\\Delta):A\\in Frm_{CF}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{LC}\n=\n\\{(\\Gamma,A,A\\Rightarrow\\Delta,\\Gamma,A\\Rightarrow\\Delta):A\\in Frm_{CF}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{LC}\n=\n\\{(\\Gamma,A,A\\Rightarrow\\Delta,\\Gamma,A\\Rightarrow\\Delta):A\\in Frm_{CF}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{RC}\n=\n\\{(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A,A,\\Delta,\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A,\\Delta):A\\in Frm_{CF}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{RC}\n=\n\\{(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A,A,\\Delta,\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A,\\Delta):A\\in Frm_{CF}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>因上下文是多重集，交换不作为独立规则。</p>\n<h1 id=\"6.-左右逻辑规则\">6. 左右逻辑规则</h1>\n<p>逻辑规则关系包含下列关系。</p>\n<p>第 5–6 节每个规则集合均按其显示前提列解释为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Seq_{CF}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times Seq_{CF}\">\\(Seq_{CF}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times Seq_{CF}\\)</span> 的子集；所有未在集合式右侧重复写出的参数统一量化为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in Frm_{CF},\n\\qquad\n\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Pi,\\Lambda\\in\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Frm_{CF}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A,B\\in Frm_{CF},\n\\qquad\n\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Pi,\\Lambda\\in\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Frm_{CF}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该覆盖声明也适用于下文 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Rule_{Cut}^{CF}\">\\(Rule_{Cut}^{CF}\\)</span>，所以它的两个前提及结论中的全部四个上下文参数都有局部可追溯的域。</p>\n<p>否定：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{\\neg L}\n=\n\\{(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A,\\Delta,\\Gamma,neg(A)\\Rightarrow\\Delta)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{\\neg L}\n=\n\\{(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A,\\Delta,\\Gamma,neg(A)\\Rightarrow\\Delta)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{\\neg R}\n=\n\\{(\\Gamma,A\\Rightarrow\\Delta,\\Gamma\\Rightarrow neg(A),\\Delta)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{\\neg R}\n=\n\\{(\\Gamma,A\\Rightarrow\\Delta,\\Gamma\\Rightarrow neg(A),\\Delta)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>合取：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{\\wedge L}\n=\n\\{(\\Gamma,A,B\\Rightarrow\\Delta,\\Gamma,and(A,B)\\Rightarrow\\Delta)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{\\wedge L}\n=\n\\{(\\Gamma,A,B\\Rightarrow\\Delta,\\Gamma,and(A,B)\\Rightarrow\\Delta)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{\\wedge R}\n=\n\\{((\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A,\\Delta,\\Gamma\\Rightarrow B,\\Delta),\\Gamma\\Rightarrow and(A,B),\\Delta)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{\\wedge R}\n=\n\\{((\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A,\\Delta,\\Gamma\\Rightarrow B,\\Delta),\\Gamma\\Rightarrow and(A,B),\\Delta)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>析取：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{\\vee L}\n=\n\\{((\\Gamma,A\\Rightarrow\\Delta,\\Gamma,B\\Rightarrow\\Delta),\\Gamma,or(A,B)\\Rightarrow\\Delta)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{\\vee L}\n=\n\\{((\\Gamma,A\\Rightarrow\\Delta,\\Gamma,B\\Rightarrow\\Delta),\\Gamma,or(A,B)\\Rightarrow\\Delta)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{\\vee R}\n=\n\\{(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A,B,\\Delta,\\Gamma\\Rightarrow or(A,B),\\Delta)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{\\vee R}\n=\n\\{(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A,B,\\Delta,\\Gamma\\Rightarrow or(A,B),\\Delta)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>蕴含：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{\\to L}\n=\n\\{((\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A,\\Delta,\\Gamma,B\\Rightarrow\\Delta),\\Gamma,imp(A,B)\\Rightarrow\\Delta)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{\\to L}\n=\n\\{((\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A,\\Delta,\\Gamma,B\\Rightarrow\\Delta),\\Gamma,imp(A,B)\\Rightarrow\\Delta)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{\\to R}\n=\n\\{(\\Gamma,A\\Rightarrow B,\\Delta,\\Gamma\\Rightarrow imp(A,B),\\Delta)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{\\to R}\n=\n\\{(\\Gamma,A\\Rightarrow B,\\Delta,\\Gamma\\Rightarrow imp(A,B),\\Delta)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>上述 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Rule_{LW},\\ldots,Rule_{\\to R}\">\\(Rule_{LW},\\ldots,Rule_{\\to R}\\)</span> 是不带标签的局部前提—结论关系；一元前提按长度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 的列读取。记其并为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"RawRule_{CF}\">\\(RawRule_{CF}\\)</span>。原始割关系为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"RawCut_{CF}\n=\\{((\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A,\\Delta,\\Pi,A\\Rightarrow\\Lambda),\n\\Gamma,\\Pi\\Rightarrow\\Delta,\\Lambda):A\\in Frm_{CF},\\quad\n\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Pi,\\Lambda\\in\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Frm_{CF})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[RawCut_{CF}\n=\\{((\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A,\\Delta,\\Pi,A\\Rightarrow\\Lambda),\n\\Gamma,\\Pi\\Rightarrow\\Delta,\\Lambda):A\\in Frm_{CF},\\quad\n\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Pi,\\Lambda\\in\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Frm_{CF})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>规则来源标签是互异的符号，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Tag_{CF}=\\{Init,LW,RW,LC,RC,\\neg L,\\neg R,\\wedge L,\\wedge R,\\vee L,\\vee R,\\to L,\\to R\\},\n\\qquad TagAll_{CF}=Tag_{CF}\\cup\\{Cut\\},\\quad Cut\\notin Tag_{CF}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Tag_{CF}=\\{Init,LW,RW,LC,RC,\\neg L,\\neg R,\\wedge L,\\wedge R,\\vee L,\\vee R,\\to L,\\to R\\},\n\\qquad TagAll_{CF}=Tag_{CF}\\cup\\{Cut\\},\\quad Cut\\notin Tag_{CF}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Src_{CF}:TagAll_{CF}\\to\\mathcal P(Seq_{CF}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times Seq_{CF})\">\\(Src_{CF}:TagAll_{CF}\\to\\mathcal P(Seq_{CF}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times Seq_{CF})\\)</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>标签 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span></th>\n<th><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Src_{CF}(t)\">\\(Src_{CF}(t)\\)</span></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Init\">\\(Init\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{((),S):S\\in Init_{CF}\\}\">\\(\\{((),S):S\\in Init_{CF}\\}\\)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"LW,RW,LC,RC\">\\(LW,RW,LC,RC\\)</span></td>\n<td>分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Rule_{LW},Rule_{RW},Rule_{LC},Rule_{RC}\">\\(Rule_{LW},Rule_{RW},Rule_{LC},Rule_{RC}\\)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg L,\\neg R\">\\(\\neg L,\\neg R\\)</span></td>\n<td>分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Rule_{\\neg L},Rule_{\\neg R}\">\\(Rule_{\\neg L},Rule_{\\neg R}\\)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\wedge L,\\wedge R\">\\(\\wedge L,\\wedge R\\)</span></td>\n<td>分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Rule_{\\wedge L},Rule_{\\wedge R}\">\\(Rule_{\\wedge L},Rule_{\\wedge R}\\)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vee L,\\vee R\">\\(\\vee L,\\vee R\\)</span></td>\n<td>分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Rule_{\\vee L},Rule_{\\vee R}\">\\(Rule_{\\vee L},Rule_{\\vee R}\\)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to L,\\to R\">\\(\\to L,\\to R\\)</span></td>\n<td>分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Rule_{\\to L},Rule_{\\to R}\">\\(Rule_{\\to L},Rule_{\\to R}\\)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Cut\">\\(Cut\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"RawCut_{CF}\">\\(RawCut_{CF}\\)</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>实际规则应用对象为三元组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(t,\\pi,S)\\in TagAll_{CF}\\times Seq_{CF}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times Seq_{CF}\">\\((t,\\pi,S)\\in TagAll_{CF}\\times Seq_{CF}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times Seq_{CF}\\)</span>。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{CF}=\\{(t,\\pi,S):t\\in Tag_{CF},\\ (\\pi,S)\\in Src_{CF}(t)\\},\n\\qquad\nRule_{Cut}^{CF}=\\{(Cut,\\pi,S):(\\pi,S)\\in RawCut_{CF}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{CF}=\\{(t,\\pi,S):t\\in Tag_{CF},\\ (\\pi,S)\\in Src_{CF}(t)\\},\n\\qquad\nRule_{Cut}^{CF}=\\{(Cut,\\pi,S):(\\pi,S)\\in RawCut_{CF}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"RuleAll_{CF}=Rule_{CF}\\cup Rule_{Cut}^{CF},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{CutFreeRule}_{CF}(r)\\Longleftrightarrow r\\in RuleAll_{CF}\\land\\pi_1(r)\\ne Cut.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[RuleAll_{CF}=Rule_{CF}\\cup Rule_{Cut}^{CF},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{CutFreeRule}_{CF}(r)\\Longleftrightarrow r\\in RuleAll_{CF}\\land\\pi_1(r)\\ne Cut.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>因此带来源标签的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Rule_{CF}\\cap Rule_{Cut}^{CF}=\\varnothing\">\\(Rule_{CF}\\cap Rule_{Cut}^{CF}=\\varnothing\\)</span>。裸关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"RawRule_{CF}\">\\(RawRule_{CF}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"RawCut_{CF}\">\\(RawCut_{CF}\\)</span> 可以相交；相同前提—结论列不会使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to L\">\\(\\to L\\)</span> 来源被误判为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Cut\">\\(Cut\\)</span> 来源。</p>\n<h1 id=\"7.-无割推导树\">7. 无割推导树</h1>\n<p>定义有限路径、根树和子节点：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Path}_{\\prec}(q,u,v)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n(q:k+1\\to\\{u,v\\}\\cup\\operatorname{dom}(\\prec)\\cup\\operatorname{rng}(\\prec)\n\\land q(0)=u\\land q(k)=v\\land\\forall i&lt;k\\ q(i)\\prec q(i+1)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Path}_{\\prec}(q,u,v)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n(q:k+1\\to\\{u,v\\}\\cup\\operatorname{dom}(\\prec)\\cup\\operatorname{rng}(\\prec)\n\\land q(0)=u\\land q(k)=v\\land\\forall i&lt;k\\ q(i)\\prec q(i+1)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RootedTree}(N,r,\\prec)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\prec\\subseteq N\\times N\\land r\\in N\\land\n\\forall n\\in N\\ \\exists!q\\ \\operatorname{Path}_{\\prec}(q,r,n),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{ch}_{N,\\prec}(n)=\\{m\\in N:n\\prec m\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{RootedTree}(N,r,\\prec)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\prec\\subseteq N\\times N\\land r\\in N\\land\n\\forall n\\in N\\ \\exists!q\\ \\operatorname{Path}_{\\prec}(q,r,n),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{ch}_{N,\\prec}(n)=\\{m\\in N:n\\prec m\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathbb N\">\\(N\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathbb N\\)</span> 上，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e_n:k_n\\to\\operatorname{ch}_{N,\\prec}(n)\">\\(e_n:k_n\\to\\operatorname{ch}_{N,\\prec}(n)\\)</span> 是严格递增的唯一双射（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k_n=|\\operatorname{ch}_{N,\\prec}(n)|\">\\(k_n=|\\operatorname{ch}_{N,\\prec}(n)|\\)</span>），并令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Prem_{N,\\prec,\\lambda}(n):k_n\\to Seq_{CF}\">\\(Prem_{N,\\prec,\\lambda}(n):k_n\\to Seq_{CF}\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Prem_{N,\\prec,\\lambda}(n)(i)=\\lambda(e_n(i))\">\\(Prem_{N,\\prec,\\lambda}(n)(i)=\\lambda(e_n(i))\\)</span>。它列举全部实际子节点，空列对应叶节点；两个前提必须来自两个不同子节点。</p>\n<p>证明对象为五元组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda,\\kappa)\">\\((N,r,\\prec,\\lambda,\\kappa)\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 记录每个节点所用的来源标签：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Tree}_{CF}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda,\\kappa)\\Longleftrightarrow\nN\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathbb N\\land\\operatorname{RootedTree}(N,r,\\prec)\n\\land\\lambda:N\\to Seq_{CF}\\land\\kappa:N\\to TagAll_{CF}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Tree}_{CF}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda,\\kappa)\\Longleftrightarrow\nN\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathbb N\\land\\operatorname{RootedTree}(N,r,\\prec)\n\\land\\lambda:N\\to Seq_{CF}\\land\\kappa:N\\to TagAll_{CF}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NodeOK}_{CF}(N,\\prec,\\lambda,\\kappa,n)\\Longleftrightarrow\nn\\in N\\land(\\kappa(n),Prem_{N,\\prec,\\lambda}(n),\\lambda(n))\\in RuleAll_{CF}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{NodeOK}_{CF}(N,\\prec,\\lambda,\\kappa,n)\\Longleftrightarrow\nn\\in N\\land(\\kappa(n),Prem_{N,\\prec,\\lambda}(n),\\lambda(n))\\in RuleAll_{CF}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>因此每个节点的实际标签、全部前提列和实际结论共同核验；叶节点仅能采用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Init\">\\(Init\\)</span>。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NoCut}_{CF}(N,\\kappa)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\kappa:N\\to TagAll_{CF}\\land\\forall n\\in N\\ \\kappa(n)\\ne Cut,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{NoCut}_{CF}(N,\\kappa)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\kappa:N\\to TagAll_{CF}\\land\\forall n\\in N\\ \\kappa(n)\\ne Cut,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Der}_{CF}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda,\\kappa)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Tree}_{CF}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda,\\kappa)\n\\land\\operatorname{NoCut}_{CF}(N,\\kappa)\n\\land\\forall n\\in N\\ \\operatorname{NodeOK}_{CF}(N,\\prec,\\lambda,\\kappa,n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Der}_{CF}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda,\\kappa)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Tree}_{CF}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda,\\kappa)\n\\land\\operatorname{NoCut}_{CF}(N,\\kappa)\n\\land\\forall n\\in N\\ \\operatorname{NodeOK}_{CF}(N,\\prec,\\lambda,\\kappa,n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-可导关系\">8. 可导关系</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta\\in Seq_{CF}\">\\(S=\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta\\in Seq_{CF}\\)</span>，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_{CF}S\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists N,r,\\prec,\\lambda,\\kappa\\,\n(\\operatorname{Der}_{CF}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda,\\kappa)\n\\land\\operatorname{RootLab}_{CF}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda,\\kappa)=S),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\vdash_{CF}S\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists N,r,\\prec,\\lambda,\\kappa\\,\n(\\operatorname{Der}_{CF}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda,\\kappa)\n\\land\\operatorname{RootLab}_{CF}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda,\\kappa)=S),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RootLab}_{CF}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda,\\kappa)=\\lambda(r),\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Cn}_{CF}=\\{S\\in Seq_{CF}:\\vdash_{CF}S\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{RootLab}_{CF}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda,\\kappa)=\\lambda(r),\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Cn}_{CF}=\\{S\\in Seq_{CF}:\\vdash_{CF}S\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>各投影仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Tree}_{CF}\">\\(\\operatorname{Tree}_{CF}\\)</span> 的域内调用。反例重放：令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B=atm(p),F=imp(B,B)\">\\(B=atm(p),F=imp(B,B)\\)</span>。裸前提列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"([F]\\Rightarrow[B],[F,B]\\Rightarrow0)\">\\(([F]\\Rightarrow[B],[F,B]\\Rightarrow0)\\)</span> 和结论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[F,F]\\Rightarrow0\">\\([F,F]\\Rightarrow0\\)</span> 同时属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Rule_{\\to L}\">\\(Rule_{\\to L}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"RawCut_{CF}\">\\(RawCut_{CF}\\)</span>。添加 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to L\">\\(\\to L\\)</span> 标签的应用通过 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"CutFreeRule_{CF}\">\\(CutFreeRule_{CF}\\)</span>；添加 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Cut\">\\(Cut\\)</span> 标签的应用被 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"NoCut_{CF}\">\\(NoCut_{CF}\\)</span> 拒绝。这里仅核验规则实例，不声称第二前提可导。正边界：单节点 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[B]\\Rightarrow[B]\">\\([B]\\Rightarrow[B]\\)</span>、来源 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Init\">\\(Init\\)</span> 给出合法无割证明；伪造来源或缺失一个实际前提的节点不满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"NodeOK_{CF}\">\\(NodeOK_{CF}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"9.-目标差异条款\">9. 目标差异条款</h1>\n<p>目标差异为：本系统的可接受推导树只采用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Tag_{CF}\">\\(Tag_{CF}\\)</span> 的来源，包括初始相继式、结构规则和左右逻辑规则。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Rule_{Cut}^{CF}\">\\(Rule_{Cut}^{CF}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"RuleAll_{CF}\">\\(RuleAll_{CF}\\)</span> 登记为核验来源的比较数据；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"NoCut_{CF}\">\\(NoCut_{CF}\\)</span> 在实际证明对象中排除全部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Cut\">\\(Cut\\)</span> 标签。</p>\n<p>目标区分对象为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_{CF}\n=\n(Tag_{CF},Src_{CF},Rule_{CF},Rule_{Cut}^{CF},\\operatorname{CutFreeRule}_{CF},\n\\operatorname{NoCut}_{CF},\\operatorname{Der}_{CF},\\vdash_{CF},\\mathsf{Cn}_{CF}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta_{CF}\n=\n(Tag_{CF},Src_{CF},Rule_{CF},Rule_{Cut}^{CF},\\operatorname{CutFreeRule}_{CF},\n\\operatorname{NoCut}_{CF},\\operatorname{Der}_{CF},\\vdash_{CF},\\mathsf{Cn}_{CF}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"10.-整个形式系统\">10. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<p>最终形式系统为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{CutFreeSequent}\n=\n\\bigl(\nProp,\nFrm_{CF},\nPV,\nSub_{CF},\n\\widehat\\sigma,\nSeq_{CF},\nInit_{CF},\nRule_{LW},\nRule_{RW},\nRule_{LC},\nRule_{RC},\nRule_{\\neg L},\nRule_{\\neg R},\nRule_{\\wedge L},\nRule_{\\wedge R},\nRule_{\\vee L},\nRule_{\\vee R},\nRule_{\\to L},\nRule_{\\to R},\nRawRule_{CF},\nRawCut_{CF},\nTag_{CF},\nTagAll_{CF},\nSrc_{CF},\nRule_{CF},\nRule_{Cut}^{CF},\nRuleAll_{CF},\n\\operatorname{CutFreeRule}_{CF},\n\\operatorname{Path}_{\\prec},\n\\operatorname{RootedTree},\n\\operatorname{ch}_{N,\\prec},\nPrem_{N,\\prec,\\lambda},\n\\operatorname{Tree}_{CF},\n\\operatorname{NodeOK}_{CF},\n\\operatorname{NoCut}_{CF},\n\\operatorname{Der}_{CF},\n\\operatorname{RootLab}_{CF},\n\\vdash_{CF},\n\\mathsf{Cn}_{CF},\n\\Delta_{CF}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{CutFreeSequent}\n=\n\\bigl(\nProp,\nFrm_{CF},\nPV,\nSub_{CF},\n\\widehat\\sigma,\nSeq_{CF},\nInit_{CF},\nRule_{LW},\nRule_{RW},\nRule_{LC},\nRule_{RC},\nRule_{\\neg L},\nRule_{\\neg R},\nRule_{\\wedge L},\nRule_{\\wedge R},\nRule_{\\vee L},\nRule_{\\vee R},\nRule_{\\to L},\nRule_{\\to R},\nRawRule_{CF},\nRawCut_{CF},\nTag_{CF},\nTagAll_{CF},\nSrc_{CF},\nRule_{CF},\nRule_{Cut}^{CF},\nRuleAll_{CF},\n\\operatorname{CutFreeRule}_{CF},\n\\operatorname{Path}_{\\prec},\n\\operatorname{RootedTree},\n\\operatorname{ch}_{N,\\prec},\nPrem_{N,\\prec,\\lambda},\n\\operatorname{Tree}_{CF},\n\\operatorname{NodeOK}_{CF},\n\\operatorname{NoCut}_{CF},\n\\operatorname{Der}_{CF},\n\\operatorname{RootLab}_{CF},\n\\vdash_{CF},\n\\mathsf{Cn}_{CF},\n\\Delta_{CF}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>主判断由记录来源的无割证明树定义。元组中的割关系仅用于比较与核验来源，不能许可无割证明中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Cut\">\\(Cut\\)</span> 节点；本条目未引入量词规则或结构解释。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-命题符号与构造子","text":"1. 命题符号与构造子","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式形成","text":"2. 公式形成","level":1},{"id":"3.-变元、替换与无绑定约定","text":"3. 变元、替换与无绑定约定","level":1},{"id":"4.-相继式与上下文","text":"4. 相继式与上下文","level":1},{"id":"5.-初始相继式与结构规则","text":"5. 初始相继式与结构规则","level":1},{"id":"6.-左右逻辑规则","text":"6. 左右逻辑规则","level":1},{"id":"7.-无割推导树","text":"7. 无割推导树","level":1},{"id":"8.-可导关系","text":"8. 可导关系","level":1},{"id":"9.-目标差异条款","text":"9. 目标差异条款","level